}
```
But for non-per-beam types, we need global tick to preserve behavior. We can branch:
```
if (sp.beamPerBeamTick) {
  beam.tick = (beam.tick ?? 0) - dt;
  if (beam.tick <= 0) { beam.tick = sp.beamTick ?? 0.12; damage }
} else {
